Phase 3 — Adaptive Auto-Layout is **COMPLETE / RELEASED** (`0.1.0-alpha.1` / `@alpha`). See `docs/architecture/phase-3-planning-audit.md` and `docs/roadmap.md`.

**DND-3.1** COMPLETE. **DND-3.2** COMPLETE. **DND-3.3** COMPLETE. **DND-3.4** COMPLETE. **DND-3.5** COMPLETE. Engine docs: `docs/architecture/auto-layout-engine.md`. Contract: `docs/architecture/auto-layout-contract.md` + ADR-0014. Release notes: `docs/releases/0.1.0-alpha.1.md`.

Framework Expansion Gate is **COMPLETE** (unnumbered; **not** Phase 4). Sprint map: `docs/architecture/framework-expansion-planning-audit.md`. Contract: `docs/architecture/framework-adapter-contract.md`. ADRs 0015–0017.

**DND-FX.1** COMPLETE (contract gate). **DND-FX.2** Vue **COMPLETE**. **DND-FX.3** Angular **COMPLETE**. **DND-FX.4** Svelte **COMPLETE**. **DND-FX.5** meta-frameworks **COMPLETE**. **DND-FX.6** Cross-Framework Alpha Release Gate **COMPLETE** (originally closed at `0.1.0-alpha.3` / `@alpha`; `0.1.0-alpha.2` superseded). The current public Alpha has since advanced to `0.1.0-alpha.4`.

